                    <nc xml:id="m-e488642d-756b-4522-aa18-1d6f68ab2411" pname="c" oct="4">
                      <signifLet xml:id="m-2918a743-97cb-4c4c-9124-726ef0e84a27" />
                    </nc>
                  </neume>
                </syllable>
                <divLine xml:id="m-aa6fd21c-0491-4b17-8342-a0e0038eb9eb" facs="#m-c4b44dae-2300-4bf8-b55d-4d1c468133a4" form="finalis" />
              </layer>
            </staff>
            <div xml:id="m-065bae98-b477-46c6-a824-d623c6826ec2">
              <lg xml:id="m-fa580f2d-ca98-4e24-8250-c6beeee0af6a">
                <l xml:id="m-76b491a6-edfe-4265-814f-f0d012aa12bc" facs="#m-624ce3b8-ef7a-483f-b50c-6607fdb5f7d2" label="ambiguous">568</l><l xml:id="m-1bed8a84-b125-4011-86ef-a9ca862d1197" facs="#m-c435b5a5-146f-4cc0-b282-ba9597bc590e" label="text-like">Ist Sunday of the Passion.</l><l xml:id="m-b7a26424-75ae-43f2-9182-5da6ba82ae6e" facs="#m-87625d8a-4f8d-49f9-9685-bc38bd916b30" label="text-like">Prayer over the people.</l><l xml:id="m-019a690f-9004-4090-aa2a-be791b35c2b1" facs="#m-deadf058-6202-494e-9507-fa8168efc4fe" label="lyrics-like">The Celebrant. Orémus. Deacon. Humiliáte cápita vestra Deo.</l><l xml:id="m-1e829377-bf0d-490b-96ed-b0dad05c577e" facs="#m-8f49d332-5112-435c-b728-b757ae3eca04" label="lyrics-like">Eus, qui sperántibus in te mise- fécimus; ut tuae consolatiónis grá¬</l><l xml:id="m-e36eb793-f6d1-4d70-9872-4c8769540a77" facs="#m-9831228a-fd52-46d5-a0bf-0357908e48f9" label="lyrics-like">U réri pótius éligis, quam irásci: tiam invenire mereámur. Per Dó¬</l><l xml:id="m-5a6f9b5e-4fc1-4973-b473-066d813aa899" facs="#m-c6dc0e85-3033-484f-940b-2e272c4ecb60" label="ambiguous">da nobis digne fiere mala, quae! minum.</l><l xml:id="m-5cd6ae52-b05a-4794-8076-e9e04d4db87d" facs="#m-ba3c7b57-08f4-47cc-94b5-edc12373fddb" label="text-like">AT VESPERS.</l><l xml:id="m-ef20dcf2-66df-4af7-a321-28c468243c4e" facs="#m-0b4fc339-d30d-44f0-aa95-df9b376b9ca7" label="text-like">Antiphons and Psalms of the Saturday, p. 307.</l><l xml:id="m-150a96ed-9739-4acc-ab8a-5e0d83a04cea" facs="#m-df37beda-b53c-4c05-ae4f-a83a39b2966c" label="lyrics-like">Chapter. Fratres : Christus assístens. 575.</l><l xml:id="m-e62ce1d4-85c5-4f30-a7e0-4e63969f736d" facs="#m-ae3daed1-ad69-4750-bebc-2457566d27fe" label="lyrics-like">Hymn. Vexilla Régis. 575. V. Eripe me.</l><l xml:id="m-024d6158-df45-4e34-9a9f-f052767bb256" facs="#m-962076b1-a5a7-4535-a4f0-f466a74981ba" label="text-like">At Magn.</l><l xml:id="m-ef8e65ca-2cf5-43d6-8ad7-e9556818f0fd" facs="#m-e8dbf0b9-dda8-4466-92ef-a25c680fe8ef" label="ambiguous">Ant. 8.G–</l><l xml:id="m-625f7732-d030-493f-acc5-80cd04792459" facs="#m-d3aae7d7-51d4-4220-940d-b03fc14d4650" label="lyrics-like">g0sum * qui testimóni-um perhíbe-o de</l><l xml:id="m-9422615e-4b8a-4938-b8d6-faf32d01d9f5" facs="#m-b37f721d-a494-46d2-98a6-a291a0e4b592" label="ambiguous">A</l><l xml:id="m-4de33eea-390e-463b-b13f-289c74874b92" facs="#m-8db40ca6-624e-4e2f-8a05-6807d266d9e5" label="lyrics-like">me-ipso:et testimóni-um pérhibet de me, qui mí-sit</l><l xml:id="m-69d15bb9-e477-4068-b5c4-b872115906a6" facs="#m-b3d2a4f3-5074-49d1-ae05-0d5241b45bf8" label="lyrics-like">me Pá-ter. E u o u a e.</l><l xml:id="m-11b8538e-82c5-4095-86b3-371759219969" facs="#m-d293f7cb-c650-4b63-bf78-7b383028c314" label="lyrics-like">Cant. Magníficat. 8. G. p. 212. — Prayer. Quaésumus omnípotens. p. 570.</l><l xml:id="m-6ca09ed4-4a21-4179-91fe-c4d83550b1ce" facs="#m-d9ca8f09-1c36-4b40-b2c6-eb00aaf41f55" label="text-like">At Compline, the Hymn is sung in the tone indicated on p. 577.</l><l xml:id="m-69886a48-f3ba-4e66-99ed-fa6236a2ae2d" facs="#m-d814b994-619e-4642-b1be-8162f77338bc" label="ambiguous"> cc c  geria</l><l xml:id="m-55600164-de74-498a-b42e-4b5faa6aecfa" facs="#m-3343560a-da20-41c6-b1f8-35cdfc0fede4" label="text-like">FIRST SUNDAY OF THE PASSION.</l><l xml:id="m-85e4dc33-137b-4873-8a31-96f3388b51fe" facs="#m-b4072133-f10d-4c5b-9cc9-45510462d295" label="text-like">Double of the First Class.</l><l xml:id="m-7bab37df-66c6-4d7d-bbc1-43f4aae47681" facs="#m-a0a5c376-262a-4ade-8820-c67957d823d5" label="text-like">AT PRIME.</l><l xml:id="m-8ff3b255-bb19-4c31-b951-6520c54ca467" facs="#m-6309378f-9bab-401d-8a6b-74c23168dcea" label="text-like">The Hymn is sung in the tone indicated at Terce.</l><l xml:id="m-0a23b02a-7653-481f-8c58-330d10efc2b4" facs="#m-16289910-deb2-446f-a70d-8468df2c5ecf" label="ambiguous">Ant.</l><l xml:id="m-ae5458f5-9166-4cc3-8c0a-d4035ddca7a8" facs="#m-3cb9fb9d-a891-46b1-9362-033055bbdeb7" label="ambiguous">8. e</l><l xml:id="m-a99a67e1-c528-4b7c-bad9-e79d54f3e828" facs="#m-20b93866-ef1e-47c1-9298-c3c1f625a1bd" label="lyrics-like">*daemóni-um non hábe-o, sed hono-rí¬</l><l xml:id="m-9b71caa3-b9e6-4dc2-9e68-89016fca89e4" facs="#m-4e773676-81b3-4bd9-9522-71790d816cdd" label="ambiguous">M</l><l xml:id="m-29bb5a87-cac8-4183-a456-fc5b55be9acb" facs="#m-ccb3c73e-ef77-46da-b584-0ee8e41a02ed" label="lyrics-like">fi-co Pá̂trem mé-um, dí-cit Dóminus. E u o u a e.</l><l xml:id="m-004d2c5b-5167-48c6-ae6d-ad712fa4cf7f" facs="#m-18555a84-80a9-420e-b35a-df2c3028b7e0" label="lyrics-like">In the Short Resp. Christe Fili Déi vivi. the Y. Glória Pátri. is not said, but</l><l xml:id="m-9b9ce6b4-c873-4a59-a858-de7b2f78b7c6" facs="#m-6d64dc16-967a-4e0c-88eb-f631ae5521b4" label="text-like">the R. Christe. is repeated. This rule is observed during the whole ot</l><l xml:id="m-8ac1b5f4-abcc-4ca9-9862-0f4c801b0229" facs="#m-ebfffbb5-ee9e-43c1-b3f3-509877bc93a5" label="lyrics-like">Passiontide, in the Ofice of the Time. On Feasts, the V. Glória Pátri. is</l><l xml:id="m-9e81b1a4-b377-409d-a538-7d9ef88d0b24" facs="#m-05f29469-60a4-4daf-ba78-d5cb3dadebd1" label="text-like">said as usual.</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
    </body>
  </music>
